<section class="container page-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Dokumentasi digital</span><h1>Kelola galeri hasil foto</h1><p>Foto baru yang diunggah fotografer bersifat privat. Admin dapat mengubahnya menjadi publik hanya setelah memperoleh izin yang sesuai.</p></section>
<section class="container admin-page"><div class="surface"><div class="surface-pad"><h2 class="h5 mb-1">Semua hasil foto</h2><p class="form-note mb-0">Akses file diperiksa di server; URL file internal tidak dipaparkan secara langsung.</p></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Pratinjau</th><th>Reservasi / pelanggan</th><th>Pengunggah</th><th>Akses</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($photos as $photo): ?><tr><td><a href="<?= e(url('download',['id'=>$photo['id_foto'],'inline'=>1])) ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?= e(url('download',['id'=>$photo['id_foto'],'inline'=>1])) ?>" alt="Foto <?= e($photo['nama_paket']) ?>" style="width:88px;height:62px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px"></a></td><td><strong><?= e($photo['nama_paket']) ?></strong><span class="subtext"><?= e($photo['kode_reservasi']) ?> · <?= e($photo['nama_pelanggan']) ?></span><span class="subtext"><?= e(date_id($photo['created_at'],true)) ?></span></td><td><?= e($photo['nama_fotografer']) ?><span class="subtext"><?= e(number_format(((int)$photo['ukuran_byte'])/1048576,2,',','.')) ?> MB</span></td><td><span class="badge-status <?= $photo['tipe_akses']==='publik'?'success':'secondary' ?>"><?= e(ucfirst($photo['tipe_akses'])) ?></span></td><td><div class="d-grid gap-2"><form method="post" action="<?= e(url('admin-gallery-action')) ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="id_foto" value="<?= (int)$photo['id_foto'] ?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="toggle"><input type="hidden" name="tipe_akses" value="<?= $photo['tipe_akses']==='publik'?'privat':'publik' ?>"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-dark" data-confirm="Ubah akses foto menjadi <?= $photo['tipe_akses']==='publik'?'privat':'publik' ?>? Pastikan persetujuan pemilik foto sudah ada." type="submit">Jadikan <?= $photo['tipe_akses']==='publik'?'Privat':'Publik' ?></button></form><form method="post" action="<?= e(url('admin-gallery-action')) ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="id_foto" value="<?= (int)$photo['id_foto'] ?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="delete"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" data-confirm="Hapus foto dari galeri dan penyimpanan secara permanen?" type="submit">Hapus Foto</button></form></div></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?><?php if(!$photos): ?><tr><td colspan="5"><div class="empty-state m-3"><div class="empty-symbol">▧</div><h3>Belum ada hasil foto</h3><p>Foto akan masuk setelah fotografer mengunggahnya dari dashboard tugas.</p></div></td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div></div></section>
